Subject: Classify German extraction noise as editorial; add Wichtig filter
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Found while reviewing the real German pair in the frontend:
- Line-break hyphenation ("Risikotragfähigkeitskon- zepte"), renumbered
  list labels ("f)" -> "b)") and fixed abbreviations ("gem. Tz.2" ->
  "gemäß Tz. 2") were content (labels even high priority); now
  editorial/low with kinds hyphenation, list_label, abbreviation.
  Suspended hyphens before conjunctions and "1." date days stay content.
- UI: "Wichtig" option in the Auswirkung filter; German labels for
  remaining English review reasons.

Real pair: editorial 2 -> 43, high priority 210 -> 202; holdout probe
14/14.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
